mentation scope</summary>\n\n`CHANGELOG.md:25`\n\n[Config] These replacements broaden service-specific controls to the whole SDK version. The new modules retain `aws-sdk-sqs`, `aws-sdk-sns`, `aws-sdk-lambda`, and `aws-sdk-bedrock-runtime`, so users following this table would disable unrelated AWS SDK instrumentation. Map each removed service selector to its corresponding feature selector; only the `*-core` aliases should map to the versioned component.\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/low-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/low-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/low-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Low severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> Migration targets broaden scope beyond removed selectors</summary>\n\n`CHANGELOG.md:28`\n\n[Config] These migration targets are broader than the removed selectors: `camel-2.20` also controls non-JMS Camel modules, while the two versioned ClickHouse names require duplicating what was previously one shared setting. The retained `camel-jms` and `clickhouse-client` selectors target the same module groups as the removed aliases, so those are the direct replacements.\n</details>\n</details>\n\n\ud83e\udde0 **Review effort:** Balanced","comment_id":null,"key":"review:5512015310","kind":"body","line":null,"path":null,"review_id":5512015310}],"frozen_at":1791941847,"frozen_at_iso":"2026-10-14T01:37:27Z","frozen_sha":"49e25d004b3d35ab28084269b9114b0a098ed783","head_ref":"trask-v3-module-naming-pr","head_repo":"open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation","head_repo_id":210933087,"input_mode":"direct","launch_run":{"actor_id":218610,"attempt":1,"id":38493370123},"loop_kind":"copilot_review","metadata":{"body":"<!--\nCHANGELOG.md is generated from merged pull requests. Do not add an entry unless this PR introduces\na deprecation or breaking change.\n-->\n\nUse versioned-first Java agent instrumentation names unconditionally and remove legacy and implementation-only enablement aliases. Part of #20510.\n\n```properties\n# Before\notel.instrumentation.cxf-3.2.enabled=false\n# After\notel.instrumentation.jaxrs-2.0-cxf-3.2.enabled=false\n```\n\nVersioned component selectors now take precedence over role, versionless, and umbrella selectors. Shared component selectors control all of their implementations; CHANGELOG.md lists replacements and changed umbrella membership.\n\nRemoves the internal `DeprecatedInstrumentationNames` extension helper. Emitted scope names and declarative selector spelling changes are separate PRs.","title":"Use versioned-first instrumentation names and remove legacy aliases"},"mode":"publish","pr":20582,"protocol":"git-candidate-v1","publication":{"auth_mode":"fine_grained_pat","authorized_actor_id":218610,"authorized_at":1791939660,"generation":2,"max_pipelines":5,"phase":"7826ac20144c4508980e0ff13ee16297","profile":"git-candidate-v1","required_checks":[]},"repo":"open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation","repo_id":210933087,"request_id":"4217573910ce479fa521644993b03c06","schema":2,"source_private":false,"target_private":false,"workflow_ref":"review-loop-revisions/5d6ad62b673c0c9d4746d35b84ef1beb64efd265","workflow_revision":"5d6ad62b673c0c9d4746d35b84ef1beb64efd265"},"review_request":{"baseline_review_ids":[5508946250,5509544158,5510062683,5512015310],"baseline_run_ids":[38498821551,38498821583,38498821594,38498821671,38498821940,38498822011],"claim":"f5e54171af924f32a321c8d93ceaa057","confirmation":{"kind":"submitted_review","review_ids":[5512231911]},"owner":{"attempt":"1","run_id":"38498691369"},"recorded_at":1791943286,"sha":"fb22a8ce56a6fc014382a204c82d579944f63f74","status":"confirmed"},"run":{"attempt":1,"conclusion":"success","id":384973338